        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-03T15:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Id have to say Nightmist. Playing her deck, more than any other, makes me feel like a paranormal investigator with sorcery that backlashes back to me. The art is all nice and dark and magic-y, which is just perfect.</p>",
