        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve said this before, and I&#39;ll say it again, The Scholar&#39;s deck is pretty good, for many of the reasons already mentioned on this thread. I also like healing as a way to do damage; I don&#39;t really know how that works thematically, but it probably involves balls of energy, and I am ALL for that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Although he&#39;s not my favorite villian to play, Iron Legacy&#39;s art is so heartbreaking. I remember playing him solo and listening to Isreal&#39;s &quot;Over the Rainbow/What a Wonderful World&quot; and the dissonance I felt was pretty powerful. The discarded picture.... that&#39;s rough.</p>",
